<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [772].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>772&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SALTWATER MEDIUM WITH HYDROGEN</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NaCl                                                   </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;20.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Na<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>                                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;4.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MgCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;6H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;3.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KCl                                                     </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> CaCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;2H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.15&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NH<sub>4</sub>Cl                                                </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.25&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KH<sub>2</sub>PO<sub>4</sub>                                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Resazurin                                               </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                       </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Mix components thoroughly, bring to a boil and cool down under a H<sub>2</sub>-CO<sub>2</sub> (4:1, v/v) gas stream.  Distribute the medium into culture vessels (e.g., 10 ml of the medium in Balch tubes) under the same gas mixture, seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave.  After cooling, add per liter the following solutions from anaerobic stocks (autoclaved or *filter-sterilized):  <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Trace element solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=439">439</a>)           </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Selenite-tungstate solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=431">431</a>)     </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Vitamin solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=403">403</a>)*                </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Thiamine solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=403">403</a>)*               </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Vitamin B<sub>1</sub><sub>2</sub> solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=403">403</a>)*      </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Riboflavin solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=462">462</a>)*             </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 1.0 M Sodium fumarate solution  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 8% NaHCO<sub>3</sub> solution*                                </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;30.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 5% Na<sub>2</sub>S&#183;9H<sub>2</sub>O                               </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;8.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Readjust pH of the medium to 7.2 - 7.4, if necessary.  Pressurize the inoculated culture vessels to 200 kPa H<sub>2</sub>-CO<sub>2</sub> (4:1, v/v).       <br>
